Package: animalsounds
Title: Print Animal Sounds
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Lorenzo", "Vives", , "lorenzo_vives@uc.cl", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides simple tools for combining animal names and the sounds
